{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyu1815/grok-build/pulls/23","id":4135999659,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTZ6LMc72hlir","html_url":"https://github.com/yuyu1815/grok-build/pull/23","diff_url":"https://github.com/yuyu1815/grok-build/pull/23.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/yuyu1815/grok-build/pull/23.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyu1815/grok-build/issues/23","number":23,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[Part 1/6] fix(build): support protoc on Windows","user":{"login":"yuyu1815","id":83267351,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMjY3MzUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83267351?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuyu1815","html_url":"https://github.com/yuyu1815","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuyu1815/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuyu1815/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuyu1815/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuyu1815/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuyu1815/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuyu1815/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuyu1815/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuyu1815/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuyu1815/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 概要\n\nWindows でも `xai-proto-build` から `protoc` を実行できるようにする、Stackの土台となるbuild専用PRです。\n\n## 変更点\n\n- Unix専用の `/dev/stdout` と `/dev/null` を、Windowsでは使用しないようにしました。\n- Windowsではdependency出力を一時ファイルへ書き、`protoc` 終了後に読み取ります。\n- descriptor出力先はWindowsのnull device `NUL`、Unix系では従来どおり `/dev/null` を使います。\n- dependency出力の先頭判定も、OSに応じて `NUL:` / `/dev/null:` を切り替えます。\n- 変更範囲は `crates/build/xai-proto-build/src/lib.rs` のみです。認証・provider・UI機能は後続PRの責務です。\n\n## 動作\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[\"protoを1件ずつ処理\"] --> B{\"実行OS\"}\n    B -->|\"Windows\"| C[\"dependency_out = 一時ファイル\"]\n    B -->|\"Unix系\"| D[\"dependency_out = /dev/stdout\"]\n    C --> E[\"descriptor_set_out = NUL\"]\n    D --> F[\"descriptor_set_out = /dev/null\"]\n    E --> G[\"protoc実行後に一時ファイルを読む\"]\n    F --> H[\"protocのstdoutを読む\"]\n    G --> I[\"NUL: を除いて依存関係を解析\"]\n    H --> J[\"/dev/null: を除いて依存関係を解析\"]\n```\n\n```text\n変更前: Windows → /dev/stdout・/dev/nullを渡す → protocで扱えない\n変更後: Windows → 一時ファイル・NULを渡す → dependencyを解析できる\n```\n\n## 確認方法 / 検証\n\n- `cargo check -p xai-proto-build` ✅\n- `git diff main...HEAD --check` ✅\n- 親との差分が `crates/build/xai-proto-build/src/lib.rs` のみであることを確認 ✅\n\n## 元PR #13からの分割\n\n- 元PR #13から Windows protoc/build 対応だけを分割しました。\n- 元PR #13は変更・closeしていません。\n\n## Stack\n\n**Part 1/6**\n\n```text\n#23 (this) → #24 → #25 → #26 → #27 → #28\n```\n\n| Part | PR | 責務 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1/6 | **#23 (this)** | Windows protoc/build対応 |\n| 2/6 | [#24](https://github.com/yuyu1815/grok-build/pull/24) | credential保存・migration |\n| 3/6 | [#25](https://github.com/yuyu1815/grok-build/pull/25) | provider credential boundary |\n| 4/6 | [#26](https://github.com/yuyu1815/grok-build/pull/26) | lifecycle・catalog・chat gate |\n| 5/6 | [#27](https://github.com/yuyu1815/grok-build/pull/27) | slash / ACP UI |\n| 6/6 | [#28](https://github.com/yuyu1815/grok-build/pull/28) | 設計docs整合 |\n\n## Depends on\n\n- Base: `main`\n- 前提PRなし（Stackのroot）","created_at":"2026-07-26T11:15:59Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T15:29:38Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"587dcb8c263ba267cc4929f700cce3dc1f79320b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11633583440,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTZ6LMc8AAAACtWplUA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyu1815/grok-build/labels/Review%20effort%202/5","name":"Review effort 2/5","color":"d1bcf9","default":false,"description":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyu1815/grok-build/pulls/23/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyu1815/grok-build/pulls/